flowchart LR
  M[Merchants / UPI adapters] --> G[Route 53 failover + WAF]
  G --> AP[API / EKS Mumbai]
  AP --> DBP[(Aurora Mumbai writer)]
  DBP -. async global replication .-> DBD[(Aurora Hyderabad hot standby)]
  AP --> KP[(MSK Mumbai)]
  KP -. MSK Replicator .-> KD[(MSK Hyderabad)]
  AP --> DP[(DynamoDB Mumbai)]
  DP -. MREC .-> DD[(DynamoDB Hyderabad)]
  AP --> RP[(Redis Mumbai primary)]
  RP -. Global Datastore .-> RD[(Redis Hyderabad)]
  AP --> SP[(S3 Mumbai)]
  SP -. CRR within India .-> SD[(S3 Hyderabad)]
  G -. fail over after fencing and promotion .-> HD[API / EKS Hyderabad]
  HD --> DBD
  HD --> KD
  HD --> DD
  HD --> RD
  HD --> SD
